e=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">身不正，虽令不从。\u201D<\/span><\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;思源黑体 CN Regular&#39;;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">D<\/span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">、\u201C圣贤施教，各因其材，小以小成<\/span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">,<\/span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">大以大成。\u201D<\/span><\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;思源黑体 CN Regular&#39;;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">16<\/span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">、\u2014次活动后，夏老师看到一个孩子钻到了桌子底下，趴在地上。于是夏老师将他叫起，问他地上那么脏，为什么趴地上<\/span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">?<\/span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">他听后委屈地掉下了眼泪，小声说<\/span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">:<\/span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">\u201C老师，地上有纸屑，我想把它捡干净。\u201D夏老师点了点头。该案例表明师幼关系具有<\/span><\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;思源黑体 CN Regular&#39;;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">A<\/span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">、选择性<\/span><\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;思源黑体 CN Regular&#39;;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">B<\/span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">、教育性<\/span><\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;思源黑体 CN Regular&#39;;fon